    <string name="home_setup_helper">Home button helper</string>
    <string name="home_setup_helper_hint">Works on Google TV and Fire TV. Turn on TV Theme in Accessibility settings.</string>
    <string name="home_setup_helper_disclosure">TV Theme uses an Android accessibility service only to notice when you press the Home button or when the built-in home screen opens, and then shows TV Theme instead. It doesn\'t read what\'s on your screen and doesn\'t collect or share any data. You can turn it off at any time in Accessibility settings.</string>
